WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.600
You want a weekend city guide. It's just you.

00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:06.560
Open Octop Bot and tell Chief.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:12.680
Chief brings Rae, Lin and Peach into a group, and splits the work.

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:17.440
Rae walks the route, Lin writes the opener, Peach draws the map.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:24.020
Scheduled work runs in the cloud, even with your computer off.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:28.420
Your next task, for your AI team.
